{"id":"f40c827a0ffac0b4","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-k4-dotted-box.md","title":"Dotted-Box Idempotence in K4","display":"lem-k4-dotted-box — Dotted-Box Idempotence in K4","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-k4-dotted-box","aliases":["89-lem-k4-dotted-box"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-k4-dotted-box — Dotted-Box Idempotence in K4","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-k4-dotted-box"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-k4-dotted-box</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-k4-dotted-box — Dotted-Box Idempotence in K4"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\)</span> 为含 4 的正规逻辑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+ A=A\\land\\Box A\">\\(\\Box^+ A=A\\land\\Box A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k4\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\Box^+A)\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+\\Box A)\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box^+A\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+\\Box^+A)\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k4\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\Box^+A)\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+\\Box A)\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box^+A\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+\\Box^+A)\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 8；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>4 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\\)</span>，盒分配给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\Box^+A\\leftrightarrow(\\Box A\\land\\Box\\Box A)\">\\(\\Box\\Box^+A\\leftrightarrow(\\Box A\\land\\Box\\Box A)\\)</span>。这证明第一式，第二式直接展开，第三式再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与第一式合取。K4 的正规性由公理模式及有限证明的替换归纳得到，与 GL 的正规性证明相同。三个结论只使用 K4，不需要 Löb。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+ A=A\\land\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k4\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\Box^+A)\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&(\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+\\Box A)\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&(\\Box^+A\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+\\Box^+A)\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\Box^+A\\leftrightarrow(\\Box A\\land\\Box\\Box A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0b83ca065132609","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e46af049d0ea6278","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb03b454c0564b96","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]"}],"outgoing":["d9f30bc0c9c793d3","95a48b6ae42f7e48","7c0e4d58dc068222"]}